  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요. 임용 첫해 재과만에서 많은 도움을 받았습니다^ㅁ^<br>신규 교사분들께 도움이 되길 바라는 마음으로 수업 자료 올려봅니다 ㅎ.ㅎ<br>학습지는&#160;김신연(경기)&#160;선생님께서&#160;올려주신&#160;활동지&#160;사용했습니다! <br><br><br><br>*&#160;다운이&#160;안되거나&#160;문제/수정&#160;사항이&#160;있으면&#160;알려주세요&#160;ㅠ.ㅠ</p><p>* 2단원은 유료 템플릿을 구매하여 제작해서 ㅠ 수정을 제한(읽기 전용)하여 공유합니다. ㅠㅠㅠ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;학습지 링크&gt;</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/1302\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/1302</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;수업 자료 링크&gt;</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1M21Q6Ob7YGwvgUlX2394zRFY3hTzcam_?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1M21Q6Ob7YGwvgUlX2394zRFY3hTzcam_?usp=sharing</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cfb4bbe70795cc4c2b94f43405b323fdde5d721d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cfb4bbe70795cc4c2b94f43405b323fdde5d721d\" data-origin-width=\"1754\" data-origin-height=\"800\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a9d16c2f5912179ff0a28ea0676542b2d323b5bb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a9d16c2f5912179ff0a28ea0676542b2d323b5bb\" data-origin-width=\"1763\" data-origin-height=\"803\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/051eeba1353bd9f6226c06553fd2218fc30ab5f0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/051eeba1353bd9f6226c06553fd2218fc30ab5f0\" data-origin-width=\"1766\" data-origin-height=\"806\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"i